    "result_text": "Full suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`).\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the email-uniqueness rule by adding one small, cohesive class:\n\n**`OwnerEmailUniquenessAspect`** (new file in `service/`) \u2014 a `@Before` aspect on `ClinicService.saveOwner(..)` that, for new owners only, compares the incoming email (case-insensitively) against existing owners and throws `ResponseStatusException(HttpStatus.CONFLICT)` \u2192 **409** on a collision.\n\nThis mirrors the existing `OwnerTelephoneUniquenessAspect` pattern exactly, so it's version-agnostic and low-risk. Structural impact is minimal: **1 file touched, 1 new method with no surrounding class complexity** (`WMC_other = 0`), and no existing method was modified or grown.",
